      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a decent start but it's a bit vague. can you go deeper into the originalist argument? specifically how they use historical evidence to define the scope of the amendment. i want to see the actual logic they use to claim certain regulations are unconstitutional.",
      "source": "evaluator"
