      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, that sounds like you're actually arguing *for* more regulation from an originalist perspective? i thought originalists were the ones fighting to strip away modern gun laws. something feels off about how you're framing their logic. can you explain why the living constitutionalist side is considered less intellectually rigorous or legally sound by most mainstream scholars?",
